Modifications: a low-rank adaptation of the language model's attention and feed-forward
projection matrices was trained and merged into those matrices. Every other tensor
(vision and audio encoders, embeddings, normalisation) is unchanged, bit for bit.
Tokenizer, processor and chat-template files are Google's, unmodified.

The reference inference code (sense.py, sense_format.py) is licensed under the Gizzai
Sense License (see LICENSE), on the same terms as the weights.

